TITLE:: InsightSpectrumView
summary:: the spectrum pane of an Insight window
categories:: Libraries>Insight
related:: Classes/Insight, Classes/InsightPanel

DESCRIPTION::
Log frequency against dB, the loudest bin in each of 128 bands: blue now, white a moment ago, dashed the loudest since reset, with the tilt of link::Classes/Insight#-tilt:: added. Stopped, it keeps the held trace and says why nothing moves.

A UserView the link::Classes/InsightPanel:: puts in a titled pane. It reads the insight and draws what it finds; the panel's updater calls refresh.

table::
## strong::drag up and down:: || the floor of the range (link::Classes/Insight#-spectrumFloor::), 0.3 dB a pixel
## strong::shift + drag:: || the same, ten times finer
## strong::wheel:: || the floor in 6 dB steps (shift: 1 dB)
## strong::double click:: || the floor back to -96
## strong::click:: || clear the held trace
## strong::hover:: || a line and the frequency, Tidal note and level under the pointer; the hint strip says the region and the held level
::

